From: IrfanMohammad <irfan@graphiant.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Jul 2023 12:50:30 +0000
Subject: descriptive lock debugs and tests

In case of a lock failure, it is more useful to have more details of the
failure, such as which CIDs are holding the lock etc.

Add tests for reader lock failures
